+    Parameters
+    ----------
+    X : {array-like, sparse matrix}
+        Data on which to apply mask.
+
+    mask : ndarray
+        Mask to be used on X.
+
+    len_mask : int
+        The length of the mask.
+
+    Returns
+    -------
+    mask : ndarray
+        Array that is safe to use on X.
